{"4584440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Offroad Frontiers", "steam_appid": 4584440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offroad Frontiers</strong> is an off-road driving experience that combines realistic vehicle physics with vast, immersive environments designed for exploration, challenge, and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your favorite <strong>4x4</strong> vehicle and push it to the limit across different terrains. From dense Colorado mountain forests and deep mud trails to Nevada scorching deserts, Alaskan ice roads and Utah spectacular Canyons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/743c2bd704429cd7a38e6754b3ccdd57.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/743c2bd704429cd7a38e6754b3ccdd57.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every surface reacts dynamically to your vehicle setup, demanding skill, strategy and precision to overcome nature's toughest obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/d3666cc81bd08952a47fc6c563680ae4.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/d3666cc81bd08952a47fc6c563680ae4.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with a focus on authenticity and player immersion, Offroad Frontiers delivers a driving experience where traction, weight, suspension, and terrain all play a critical role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/11a17555f3d01fbe2a7ee4a930f01e99.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/11a17555f3d01fbe2a7ee4a930f01e99.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether climbing steep rocky paths, navigating flooded routes, or escaping deep mud, every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a flexible experience that caters to both simulation enthusiasts and players looking for a more relaxed exploration style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/57fa8cffe100ec3208b4881d87631981.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/57fa8cffe100ec3208b4881d87631981.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in structured missions such as recovery operations, deliveries, and time challenges, or freely explore expansive environments at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/06e7c87eb876356e1e7b89e415c050cf.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/06e7c87eb876356e1e7b89e415c050cf.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Open World Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Navigate deep mud with realistic deformation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Climb rocky trails and unstable slopes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Rivers and lakes with water deformation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Trailer Towing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Vehicle recovery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-15+ 4x4 Off-Road Vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4×4 SUVs built for exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Heavy-duty pickup trucks for towing and power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Classic off-roaders with raw mechanical feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fully equipped expedition vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Detailed Vehicle customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Online Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dynamic Weather with Day, Night and Sunset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Authentic environments with wildlife and natural obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/21df9feac523b42ce3531ccb2eaf824a.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/21df9feac523b42ce3531ccb2eaf824a.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse, handcrafted maps inspired by real-world locations:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 Forest &amp; Wetlands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense forests filled with mud traps, rivers, and hidden paths. Visibility is low, traction is worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏜️ Desert</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide open spaces with soft sand, rocky canyons, and extreme heat conditions. Momentum is key.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏔️ Canyon &amp; Rocky Terrain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technical driving at its finest — narrow paths, steep drops, and precision required at every turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >❄️ Snow &amp; Ice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slippery surfaces, reduced grip, and harsh conditions that test your control and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/a159a194d1cd73f18d8ac1ba261388a6.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/a159a194d1cd73f18d8ac1ba261388a6.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Multiplayer &amp; Convoys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the wilderness alone or with others:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience true off-road cooperation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive together in shared environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help recover stuck vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan routes and tackle challenges as a team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/3b5dd1d7d1870f7e85c46dfd8f02db6f.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/3b5dd1d7d1870f7e85c46dfd8f02db6f.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Missions &amp; Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging objectives across different maps:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based trail challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recovery and transport missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based routes with multiple approaches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/1c89ed71fb415c9447e239991797b6b3.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/1c89ed71fb415c9447e239991797b6b3.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offroad Frontiers</strong> is an off-road driving experience that combines realistic vehicle physics with vast, immersive environments designed for exploration, challenge, and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your favorite <strong>4x4</strong> vehicle and push it to the limit across different terrains. From dense Colorado mountain forests and deep mud trails to Nevada scorching deserts, Alaskan ice roads and Utah spectacular Canyons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/743c2bd704429cd7a38e6754b3ccdd57.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/743c2bd704429cd7a38e6754b3ccdd57.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every surface reacts dynamically to your vehicle setup, demanding skill, strategy and precision to overcome nature's toughest obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/d3666cc81bd08952a47fc6c563680ae4.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/d3666cc81bd08952a47fc6c563680ae4.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with a focus on authenticity and player immersion, Offroad Frontiers delivers a driving experience where traction, weight, suspension, and terrain all play a critical role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/11a17555f3d01fbe2a7ee4a930f01e99.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/11a17555f3d01fbe2a7ee4a930f01e99.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether climbing steep rocky paths, navigating flooded routes, or escaping deep mud, every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a flexible experience that caters to both simulation enthusiasts and players looking for a more relaxed exploration style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/57fa8cffe100ec3208b4881d87631981.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/57fa8cffe100ec3208b4881d87631981.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in structured missions such as recovery operations, deliveries, and time challenges, or freely explore expansive environments at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/06e7c87eb876356e1e7b89e415c050cf.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/06e7c87eb876356e1e7b89e415c050cf.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Open World Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Navigate deep mud with realistic deformation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Climb rocky trails and unstable slopes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Rivers and lakes with water deformation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Trailer Towing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Vehicle recovery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-15+ 4x4 Off-Road Vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4×4 SUVs built for exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Heavy-duty pickup trucks for towing and power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Classic off-roaders with raw mechanical feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fully equipped expedition vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Detailed Vehicle customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Online Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dynamic Weather with Day, Night and Sunset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Authentic environments with wildlife and natural obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/21df9feac523b42ce3531ccb2eaf824a.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/21df9feac523b42ce3531ccb2eaf824a.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse, handcrafted maps inspired by real-world locations:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌲 Forest &amp; Wetlands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense forests filled with mud traps, rivers, and hidden paths. Visibility is low, traction is worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏜️ Desert</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide open spaces with soft sand, rocky canyons, and extreme heat conditions. Momentum is key.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏔️ Canyon &amp; Rocky Terrain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technical driving at its finest — narrow paths, steep drops, and precision required at every turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >❄️ Snow &amp; Ice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slippery surfaces, reduced grip, and harsh conditions that test your control and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/a159a194d1cd73f18d8ac1ba261388a6.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/a159a194d1cd73f18d8ac1ba261388a6.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Multiplayer &amp; Convoys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the wilderness alone or with others:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience true off-road cooperation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive together in shared environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help recover stuck vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan routes and tackle challenges as a team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/3b5dd1d7d1870f7e85c46dfd8f02db6f.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/3b5dd1d7d1870f7e85c46dfd8f02db6f.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Missions &amp; Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging objectives across different maps:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based trail challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recovery and transport missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based routes with multiple approaches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras/1c89ed71fb415c9447e239991797b6b3.avif?t=1778973384\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/extras_big/1c89ed71fb415c9447e239991797b6b3.avif?t=1778973384 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Offroad Frontiers is an off-road driving experience that combines realistic vehicle physics with vast, immersive environments designed for exploration, challenge, and freedom. Drive your favorite 4x4 vehicle and push it to the limit across different terrains.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584440/680a5cb589366c